<span id="S2.T2.2.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:82.5pt;">
<span id="S2.T2.2.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.T2.2.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#B30000;">✗</span> Trust-based</span>
</span></td>
